# harness-eng — suggested gitignore entries
# Append to repo root .gitignore if missing.
# example_only：Do not commit real MCP secrets（下列 mcp.json 真密路径；本地可填）。
# vendored_shared：render 会跳过 mcp.json 忽略行（团队约定跟踪共享真密）。
.cursor/mcp.json
.mcp.json
.trae/mcp.json
# fill-truths worker fragments (merge into SSOT via fill-merge-api)
docs/api/.fill-work/
docs/**/.fill-work/
